          <p>Advanced vision AI reads handwritten and typed answer sheets with high accuracy, converting PDF submissions into structured text.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="brain"></i></div>
          <h3>AI-Powered Grading</h3>
          <p>LLM-based grading matches student answers against rubric key points, awards partial credit, and provides detailed feedback.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="bar-chart-3"></i></div>
          <h3>Deep Analytics</h3>
          <p>Question difficulty analysis, grade distributions, at-risk student identification, and AI-generated teaching recommendations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i data-lucide="message-circle"></i></div>
          <h3>AI Teaching Assistant</h3>
          <p>Chat with an AI that knows your exam data. Ask about trends, get rubric suggestions, or identify students needing support.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
