      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <p>Four simple steps from exam papers to complete gradebooks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="workflow-steps">
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <h3>Set Up</h3>
          <p>Create your course, import the student roster, and define the exam with questions and rubric.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <h3>Upload</h3>
          <p>Upload scanned answer sheets as PDFs -- one per student. Batch upload is supported.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <h3>Grade</h3>
          <p>AI reads each submission via OCR, maps answers to rubric questions, and grades with detailed feedback.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <div class="step-num">04</div>
          <h3>Review & Export</h3>
          <p>Review grades, apply overrides, analyze class performance, and export a polished Excel gradebook.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
